Package: scRNAseqPhysalia2026
Title: Single-cell RNA-seq analysis with R/Bioconductor (Physalia 2026)
Description:
    Course material for the 2026 edition of the Physalia workshop
    "Single-cell RNA-seq analysis with R/Bioconductor". This BiocBook gathers
    the lectures and hands-on labs of the five-day course: from sequencing
    reads to count matrices, quality control, normalisation, dimensionality
    reduction, clustering and cell annotation, batch correction, single-cell
    ATAC-seq and trajectory inference. A Docker image providing every tool,
    package and dataset used in the labs is built for each version of the
    book, and is used to run the workshop on the Bioconductor Orchestra
    platform.
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-06
